cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  bioc-contrib-intelligence: review-queue intelligence for Bioconductor
  package submissions
message: If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sean
    family-names: Davis
    email: seandavi@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/seandavi/bioc-contrib-intelligence
url: https://bioc-reviews.seandavi.workers.dev
abstract: >-
  Derives the current state of each Bioconductor package submission (whose
  move it is, how long it has waited, current r-universe check results) from
  the BiocContributions issue tracker and r-universe, and serves it to
  reviewers and the core team through a web app and API.
keywords:
  - bioconductor
  - r
  - code-review
  - peer-review
  - r-universe
license: MIT
